※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4939 LANG_DELEGATE_ANSWERS_NOTHING

※ `yield ⇉` comes to a value only where the generator it hands the walk to says
※ what it answers when it ends, `→ T` after the rest of its signature.  One that
※ says nothing has nothing more and no answer.

let std := ⎕import("std")

fn counted() ⇉ u8:
    yield 1u8

fn summed() ⇉ u8:
    let n: u8 = yield ⇉ counted()
    yield n

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let total: mut u8 = 0u8
    foreach one := summed():
        total ← total + one
    if total = 1u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
